title: Which loop should I use?
kind: tree
box q: Do you know how many times the loop runs before it starts?
box yes: `for`
box no: Must the body run at least once?
box once: `do` ... `while`
box zero: `while`
box count: counting up\nor down
box each: walking an array by index
q -> yes: yes
q -> no: no
yes -> count
yes -> each
no -> once: yes
no -> zero: no
hot: yes
